{
	title: 'Reliable card collapse with native selection',
	spec: 'Restore the web invariant that a deliberate expansion-button activation always toggles its card, including long tool output, even with a selection or no document Selection object. Body clicks preserve a nonempty selection intersecting that card but are not blocked by selection elsewhere. Links and other card controls retain their actions without toggling. Preserve identity, per-session fold state and complete output. This repairs browser selection gating only; terminal fold behavior is unchanged.',
